S Code only discovers skills that are direct children of the skills\nroot. Refactored installer to copy every skill as targetDir/<name>/\ninstead of preserving the nested source hierarchy.\n\n- Added findSkillDirs(), copySkillFlat(), resolveSkillsForPath()\n- installSkills() now flattens all skills, auto-detects ancestor\n  orchestrators (e.g. software/SKILL.md for software/frontend path)\n- updateSkills() handles legacy nested manifest paths, cleans orphans\n- cleanSkills() simplified for flat names with legacy path fallback\n- Manifest ''skills'' field now stores flat names ([''frontend'', ''gdpr''])\n  instead of nested paths ([''software/frontend''])","tree":{"sha":"983c728cb7ddcc5170ee29892b65063e2c273f52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mauriciodelrio/delriodev-skills/git/trees/983c728cb7ddcc5170ee29892b65063e2c273f52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mauriciodelrio/delriodev-skills/git/commits/b96ef05f8052daf4242108466ff8682c2dcf3957","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6444195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciodelrio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciodelrio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciodelrio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciodelrio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mauriciodelrio","id":6444195,"login":"mauriciodelrio","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDQxOTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciodelrio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciodelrio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciodelrio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciodelrio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciodelrio/subscriptions","type":