type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/d939ce58a54297f095601e7b1d5eeadf6b07c1db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:36:34Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T20:36:34Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"message":"docs(skills): add openclaude-chat-styling skill + README reference\n\nAnthropic Skill que documenta o pattern de estilo para integrar <Chat>\nem qualquer host com tema claro/escuro funcional. Cobre as 3 armadilhas\nmais comuns:\n\n1. @theme { --color-X: var(--X) } congela o valor no :root e ignora\n   body.light. Fix: usar @theme inline (resolucao lazy no ponto de uso).\n2. Tokens duplicados em pacotes filhos sobrescrevem o host. Fix: tokens\n   so no host; pacotes filhos so o mapping @theme inline.\n3. @originjs/vite-plugin-federation nao carrega o CSS do remote junto\n   do JS exposed. Fix: cssCodeSplit:false + assetFileNames estavel +\n   <link rel=\"stylesheet\"> injetado no host antes de montar.\n\nREADME aponta para skills/openclaude-chat-styling/SKILL.md com resumo\ndas tres camadas e instrucoes de instalacao via ~/.claude/skills/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6cd2a664761d0c42e8732972947271ca48fb91a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/trees/6cd2a664761d0c42e8732972947271ca48fb91a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/commits/d939ce58a54297f095601e7b1d5eeadf6b07c1db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_ur