arred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/c07f03864f6008fb2480ae66f999f47eb8257785/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:14:02Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:14:02Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"message":"build(0.6.1): dual distribution — fat tarball (dist/index.js + exports) + source registry\n\nThe 0.6.0 tarball was source-only (no main/exports) so consumers via\nfile:vendor/*.tgz couldn''t import — only shadcn-add-style consumers\nworked. Hub team blocked on bump.\n\nThis release adds:\n- tsup.config.ts: ESM bundle of src/index.ts (externals = peerDeps +\n  node_modules; treeshake; sourcemap; dts)\n- package.json: main/module/types/exports map (`./styles.css`,\n  `./registry/*`, `./package.json`); files now includes `dist`\n- npm scripts: `build` (tsup)\n\nBoth consumption modes coexist:\n- Tarball: `import { Chat } from \"@codrstudio/openclaude-chat\"` —\n  resolves to dist/index.js\n- Registry: `npx shadcn add @codrstudio/openclaude-chat` — copies src/\n  into the consumer\n\ndist/index.js: 203KB, dist/index.d.ts: 48KB.","tree":{"sha":"5cdc15cabb25c9a5f39a312e54ad235866fbbcee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/trees/5cdc15cabb25c9a5f39a312e54ad235866fbbcee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/commits/c07f03864f6008fb2480ae66f999f47eb8257785","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/c07f03864f6008fb2480ae66f999f47eb8257785","node_id":"C_kwDOSASfXdoAKGMwN2YwMzg2NGY2MDA4ZmIyNDgwYWU2NmY5OTlmNDdlYjgyNTc3ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/e7854ab791ca936f1a1b44daf234ecb316eb7abe","sha":"e7854ab791ca936f1a1b44daf234ecb316eb7abe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/e7854ab791ca936f1a1b44daf234ecb316eb7abe"}],"sha":"c07f03864f6008fb2480ae66f999f47eb8257785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/c07f03864f6008fb2480ae66f999f47eb8257785"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/e7854ab791ca936f1a1b44daf234ecb316eb7abe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:44:59Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:44:59Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"message":"feat(artifacts): implement parser + 6 type renderers + identifier update\n\nPhase B+C of the artifacts pivot. Agent emits <antArtifact> tags in\nTextBlocks; chat parses + renders in dedicated cards.\n\n- src/artifacts/parser.ts (new): regex-based tag extractor; returns\n  Segment[] (text|artifact). Tolerant: malformed/unknown-type tags fall\n  back to text. Tested with 10 cases (JSX, multi-tag, streaming, attr\n  order, escaping).\n- ChatProvider: tracks artifactLatestAddress per identifier — Map populated\n  by scanning all message text parts. Used for supersede dedup.\n- PartRenderer: ArtifactAwareText interleaves Markdown + ArtifactCard\n  segments inside a single text part. Older artifacts with the same\n  identifier collapse to a \"↻ atualizado abaixo\" placeholder.\n- ArtifactCard: header (icon + title + lang label + actions) over body.\n  Common toolbar: copy, download, optional preview/source toggle, optional\n  open-in-new-tab (HTML/SVG).\n- 6 renderers (single-file each):\n  - CodeRenderer: reuses Markdown + rehype-highlight via fence\n  - HtmlRenderer: iframe sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" via srcdoc, auto-height\n  - SvgRenderer: dangerouslySetInnerHTML + lightweight sanitize (drops\n    <script>, on*= handlers, javascript: hrefs)\n  - MermaidRenderer: lazy-imported mermaid lib, securityLevel strict\n  - ReactRenderer: wraps AppHost + stable actions via useRef (so artifact\n    state survives ChatContext re-renders)\n- mermaid: ^11 added as dependency\n- i18n: artifact.* keys for action labels and error states (pt-BR/en/es)\n\nValidated end-to-end via Chrome MCP: all 6 types render correctly, react\ncounter increments interactively (DOM verified), identifier update\ncollapses prior card and replaces with new content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e45d286d47e1cb6375bf593208854cdef0e6a25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/trees/3e45d286d47e1cb6375bf593208854cdef0e6a25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/commits/e7854ab791ca936f1a1b44daf234ecb316eb7abe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/e7854ab791ca936f1a1b44daf234ecb316eb7abe","node_id":"C_kwDOSASfXdoAKGU3ODU0YWI3OTFjYTkzNmYxYTFiNDRkYWYyMzRlY2IzMTZlYjdhYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/07aa90b92310abdffcb032be7f9c5ce7dd982653","sha":"07aa90b92310abdffcb032be7f9c5ce7dd982653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/07aa90b92310abdffcb032be7f9c5ce7dd982653"}],"sha":"e7854ab791ca936f1a1b44daf234ecb316eb7abe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/e7854ab791ca936f1a1b44daf234ecb316eb7abe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/07aa90b92310abdffcb032be7f9c5ce7dd982653/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:24:19Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:24:19Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"message":"feat(artifacts): pivot to <antArtifact> tag parsing; drop MCP/proxy wiring\n\nMirrors openclaude-sdk pivot: agent emits <antArtifact> tags inside\nTextBlocks; chat parses and renders. Six MIME types (code, markdown,\nhtml, svg, mermaid, react).\n\n- src/artifacts/ (renamed from src/app/): keeps compile/runtime/AppHost\n  for type=react. Single-file source instead of bundle. Drop compat-v1\n  and inline FORBIDDEN_CONSTRUCTS into compile.ts.\n- types.ts: AppOutputPart -> ArtifactPart (discriminated by MIME-like\n  artifactType + identifier for update semantics)\n- transport: drop proxyFetch\n- hook: drop enableAppOutput/enableDataProxy/proxyHandler/appDataFetcher;\n  add enableArtifacts (declares clientCapabilities.artifacts: true and\n  enables tag parsing)\n- Chat: drop enableAppOutput/enableDataProxy props; add enableArtifacts\n- PartRenderer: case \"artifact\" -> ArtifactCard (stub; full renderers\n  follow in next commits)\n- i18n: app.* keys -> artifact.* across pt-BR/en-US/es-ES\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae53ddbe1935c828eb1acff9f747e18c758a0992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/trees/ae53ddbe1935c828eb1acff9f747e18c758a0992"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/commits/07aa90b92310abdffcb032be7f9c5ce7dd982653","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/07aa90b92310abdffcb032be7f9c5ce7dd982653","node_id":"C_kwDOSASfXdoAKDA3YWE5MGI5MjMxMGFiZGZmY2IwMzJiZTdmOWM1Y2U3ZGQ5ODI2NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/8858e67549d3ee215c0c6c36d859b94a4d52196b","sha":"8858e67549d3ee215c0c6c36d859b94a4d52196b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/8858e67549d3ee215c0c6c36d859b94a4d52196b"}],"sha":"07aa90b92310abdffcb032be7f9c5ce7dd982653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/07aa90b92310abdffcb032be7f9c5ce7dd982653"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/8858e67549d3ee215c0c6c36d859b94a4d52196b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T16:26:44Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T16:26:44Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"message":"feat: native AskUserQuestion form (interactive multi-choice mid-turn)\n\nAdds first-class UI support for the CLI''s native AskUserQuestion tool.\nPairs with @codrstudio/openclaude-sdk''s persistent session route — when\nthe agent invokes AskUserQuestion, the bridge emits an\n`ask_user_question_request` SSE event which this hook captures, renders\nas an inline form, and routes the user''s answers back via a new transport\nmethod.\n\ntypes.ts:\n- AskUserQuestionPart (callId, questions, resolved, submitting, error)\n- AskUserQuestionItem / Option / Annotation / Answers types\n- New variant added to MessagePart union\n\ntransport.ts:\n- ChatTransport.respondToAskUserQuestion(conversationId, callId, response)\n- ChatTransport.cancelAskUserQuestion(conversationId, callId)\n- createDefaultTransport implements both via POST/DELETE on\n  /conversations/:id/ask-user-question/:callId\n\nuseOpenClaudeChat.ts:\n- New options: clientCapabilities (sent in POST /conversations body)\n- New return values: respondToAskUserQuestion / cancelAskUserQuestion\n- SSE handlers for \"ask_user_question_request\" (push as part) and\n  \"ask_user_question_resolved\" (mark part as resolved/cancelled inline)\n- updatePart helper that merges patches into the matching part by callId\n\nparts/AskUserQuestionForm.tsx (new):\n- Card with progress indicator (X de N)\n- Single-select (radio) and multi-select (checkbox) variants\n- Header chip + question text + option list with label/description\n- Footer with Cancelar + Responder buttons\n- States: input, submitting (spinner), resolved (collapsed summary\n  with green check), cancelled, error (with retry message)\n\nPartRenderer.tsx:\n- New case \"ask-user-question\" delegating to AskUserQuestionForm\n- Imports + type updates\n\nChat.tsx:\n- New prop enableAskUserQuestion (default false)\n- When true, propagates clientCapabilities.askUserQuestion to the hook\n  which sends it in POST /conversations. Server decides if it respects.\n- Renderer is always available; the prop signals intent to the bridge.\n\ni18n locales (en-US, pt-BR, es-ES):\n- 9 new keys under askUser.* (title, submit, submitting, cancel,\n  cancelled, resolved, errorSubmit, multiSelectHint, progress)\n\nVerified end-to-end via Playwright: agent emits AskUserQuestion with 3\noptions, form renders with chip + question + 3 option cards, user clicks\nOAuth, click Responder, card collapses to \"Respondido — Auth → OAuth\"\nwith green check, agent continues with \"OAuth selecionado. Como quer\nprosseguir?\".\n\nPending for full RTM (see TASK.md in the demo): preview side-panel for\noptions with markdown, annotations textarea, \"Outro\" implicit free-text\ninput, sticky header for batch >1, axe-core a11y validation, formal\ntest suite.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc9fa79847263aa42298dec299c84fc42111465f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/trees/bc9fa79847263aa42298dec299c84fc42111465f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/commits/8858e67549d3ee215c0c6c36d859b94a4d52196b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/8858e67549d3ee215c0c6c36d859b94a4d52196b","node_id":"C_kwDOSASfXdoAKDg4NThlNjc1NDlkM2VlMjE1YzBjNmMzNmQ4NTliOTRhNGQ1MjE5NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/fe0d259ec0433b817445a0be6869bfb4d9a4ad4d","sha":"fe0d259ec0433b817445a0be6869bfb4d9a4ad4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/fe0d259ec0433b817445a0be6869bfb4d9a4ad4d"}],"sha":"8858e67549d3ee215c0c6c36d859b94a4d52196b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/8858e67549d3ee215c0c6c36d859b94a4d52196b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/fe0d259ec0433b817445a0be6869bfb4d9a4ad4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T13:45:03Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T13:45:03Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"message":"chore: distribute as shadcn registry only (drop dist), bump 0.5.1\n\nThe library is built around Tailwind v4 utilities scanned via @source\non TSX files. Installing as an npm runtime dep places files under\nnode_modules/dist/*.js where Tailwind doesn''t scan, so the chat renders\nwithout styles. Only the shadcn-way (source-copy via `npx shadcn add`)\nworks without extra host configuration.\n\nAligning the package with reality:\n- README rewritten to lead with shadcn install (caminho A: shadcn CLI;\n  caminho B: install.mjs fallback). Top of README explains why\n  npm install does not work in practice. Includes minimal end-to-end\n  example and link to the bridge guide in the SDK README.\n- package.json marked private:true; main/types/exports/build scripts\n  removed. files: [\"src\", \"registry\", \"README.md\"]. Build deps\n  cssnano/postcss/postcss-cli/@tailwindcss/postcss dropped.\n- dist/, postcss.config.mjs and old .tgz artifacts removed.\n- Registry rebuilt with new sources (status-toast/compact-boundary/\n  prompt-suggestion renderers, enableStreamingIndicator prop, transport\n  + autoLoadHistory props, HistoryContent reading from context).\n- Bumps to 0.5.1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d88f4f92111e9e3fe3234aa0fca3c01f563920af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/trees/d88f4f92111e9e3fe3234aa0fca3c01f563920af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/commits/fe0d259ec0433b817445a0be6869bfb4d9a4ad4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/fe0d259ec0433b817445a0be6869bfb4d9a4ad4d","node_id":"C_kwDOSASfXdoAKGZlMGQyNTllYzA0MzNiODE3NDQ1YTBiZTY4NjliZmI0ZDlhNGFkNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/55a2ff16d45a588e1faa236f4d2ab0bc2860c766","sha":"55a2ff16d45a588e1faa236f4d2ab0bc2860c766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/55a2ff16d45a588e1faa236f4d2ab0bc2860c766"}],"sha":"fe0d259ec0433b817445a0be6869bfb4d9a4ad4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/fe0d259ec0433b817445a0be6869bfb4d9a4ad4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/55a2ff16d45a588e1faa236f4d2ab0bc2860c766/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T13:44:28Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T13:44:28Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"message":"feat: status-toast/compact-boundary/prompt-suggestion + provider-driven\n\nPartRenderer now handles three previously-orphan part types that the\nhook already pushed but had no renderer for:\n- `status-toast` — pill with Loader2/Check pra inline progress feedback\n- `compact-boundary` — divider with savedTokens\n- `prompt-suggestion` — dotted card with Sparkles\n\nuseOpenClaudeChat consolidates status-toast in-place (instead of\npushing) and marks `done = true` when the assistant message arrives,\nso the Loader2 turns into a green Check.\n\nStatus types added to types.ts as named MessagePart variants\n(StatusToastPart, CompactBoundaryPart, PromptSuggestionPart).\n\ni18n: `part.compactBoundary` key added to en-US/pt-BR/es-ES.\n\n<Chat> ganha duas props pra eliminar boilerplate de host:\n- `enableStreamingIndicator` (default true) — desliga \"...\" quando o\n  servidor já manda comfort messages (status-toast)\n- `transport` + `autoLoadHistory` (default true) — quando sessionId\n  muda, o hook chama transport.getMessages() automaticamente e popula\n  initialMessages. Aceita SDKMessage cru ou Message convertida.\n\n<History> agora lê transport, activeConversationId e onSelectConversation\ndo HistoryContext quando props diretas não vêm — eliminando o\nboilerplate de repassar tudo no <HistorySidebar>.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9f836a2a6caf94a9128d2fea50664b4c253c963","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/trees/f9f836a2a6caf94a9128d2fea50664b4c253c963"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/commits/55a2ff16d45a588e1faa236f4d2ab0bc2860c766","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gugacoder","id":1300178,"login":"gugacoder","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDAxNzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/55a2ff16d45a588e1faa236f4d2ab0bc2860c766","node_id":"C_kwDOSASfXdoAKDU1YTJmZjE2ZDQ1YTU4OGUxZmFhMjM2ZjRkMmFiMGJjMjg2MGM3NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commit/0a16dfa6e6e9503f6de06cec6dce7496353e7119","sha":"0a16dfa6e6e9503f6de06cec6dce7496353e