.com/users/gugacoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/commits/21ff3b8694ce2fa0c023b54117cab6bd6908cbb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T02:45:13Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T02:45:13Z","email":"guga.coder@gmail.com","name":"Guga Coder"},"message":"build: trocar @tailwindcss/cli por @tailwindcss/postcss + postcss-cli\n\n@tailwindcss/cli importa @parcel/watcher no load do modulo mesmo sem watch,\ne @parcel/watcher publica binarios nativos por plataforma como optionalDeps,\nque o lockfile do npm nao consegue travar cross-platform — causando falha\nde build em CI Linux quando o lockfile foi gerado em Windows.\n\nA solucao via @tailwindcss/postcss + postcss-cli elimina a dependencia nativa\ne e o caminho documentado pelo Tailwind v4 para builds que nao precisam de\nwatch mode. Minificacao via cssnano.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db06bbbbe893876853f096f5caec56a2f5d57f78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/trees/db06bbbbe893876853f096f5caec56a2f5d57f78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codrstudio/openclaude-chat/git/commits/21ff3b8694ce2fa0c023b54117cab6bd6908cbb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1300178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gugacoder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://gi