site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/1f020a45d4bd2b019fda8b5115c49643961e4b88","node_id":"C_kwDOSAUwK9oAKDFmMDIwYTQ1ZDRiZDJiMDE5ZmRhOGI1MTE1YzQ5NjQzOTYxZTRiODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae","sha":"0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae"}],"sha":"1f020a45d4bd2b019fda8b5115c49643961e4b88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/1f020a45d4bd2b019fda8b5115c49643961e4b88"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/2c5648d7dbaf7eb60716b36372acd7b1349b4ffc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:44:15Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:44:15Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"message":"Add createAudioEngine + chiptune soundpack plugin\n\nPromotes the clicker''s inline Sound IIFE into a reusable library-level\nplugin surface parallel to the animation engine. Soundpacks are plain\nobjects with `oneshots` (fire-and-forget voices) and `ambients` (sustained\ndrones keyed by channel + variant) that the engine dispatches against;\n`use(pack)` / `setActivePack(name)` swap them like any other plugin.\n\nNew modules\n- `src/audio-engine.js` — `createAudioEngine(config)` factory. Manages\n  AudioContext lifecycle (lazy init on user gesture), master gain, one-shot\n  and ambient summing buses, pack registry, and crossfading ambient channels\n  (one active variant per channel). API: init/start/stop, use/setActivePack,\n  fire, setAmbient/clearAmbient/clearAll, setEnabled/setMasterVolume.\n- `src/audio-packs/chiptune.js` — first reference pack. Extracts the\n  17-tier drone registry, Shepard-tone click blip, tier-stinger, milestone\n  arpeggios (medium/big/huge), ONE THOUSAND fanfare, black-flash boom, and\n  nuclear whoosh+impact from the clicker''s inline audio. Uses a\n  `getTierDrone(idx)` function-call indirection so esbuild can''t hoist\n  `TIER_DRONES[i]` out of the ambient factories — runtime substitutions\n  via `chiptunePack.tierDrones[n] = cfg` take effect on the next\n  setAmbient(''tier'', n).\n\nBuild\n- `build.js` gains an `audioPacks` array; produces `dist/audio-packs/\n  chiptune.{esm,min}.js` (8.6KB IIFE, `TotoFXAudioChiptune` global). Main\n  bundle grows ~2.4KB for the engine.\n\nClicker refactor\n- Replaces the ~500-line inline Sound IIFE + SOUND_PACKS definition with a\n  compact adapter that creates the audio engine, registers the chiptune\n  pack, and exposes the same Sound.* API the existing hook call sites\n  already use. Preserves first-reach ONE THOUSAND gating as a game\n  concern (not an engine concern).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80caaa082c8a956ab1e319cc731f1e59843ba3a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/trees/80caaa082c8a956ab1e319cc731f1e59843ba3a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/commits/2c5648d7dbaf7eb60716b36372acd7b1349b4ffc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/2c5648d7dbaf7eb60716b36372acd7b1349b4ffc","node_id":"C_kwDOSAUwK9oAKDJjNTY0OGQ3ZGJhZjdlYjYwNzE2YjM2MzcyYWNkN2IxMzQ5YjRmZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/926cb0334e996bce033ca6d45ba99d1520bc0fde","sha":"926cb0334e996bce033ca6d45ba99d1520bc0fde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/926cb0334e996bce033ca6d45ba99d1520bc0fde"}],"sha":"2c5648d7dbaf7eb60716b36372acd7b1349b4ffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/2c5648d7dbaf7eb60716b36372acd7b1349b4ffc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/926cb0334e996bce033ca6d45ba99d1520bc0fde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:33:24Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:33:24Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"message":"Add Three.js compatibility demos + speed-clicker game under examples/\n\nEight single-file HTML demos showing TotoFX layered over a Three.js WebGL\nscene. The body/overlay compositor pattern (WebGL canvas at z:0, dotgrid\noverlay at z:1 with pointer-events:none, shake/flash on document.body)\nkeeps both layers in lockstep. Each demo references ../../dist/toto-fx.min.js\nvia relative path; Three.js via jsdelivr importmap. Zero build step.\n\nexamples/threejs-meteor/       — blueprint: meteor falls, dotgrid ripples, 3D debris\nexamples/threejs-anime-slam/   — katana follows cursor, cuts bamboo on contact\nexamples/threejs-nuke/         — missile razes a city grid with radial force physics\nexamples/threejs-explode/      — red barrel shatters into shrapnel + fireball\nexamples/threejs-sniper/       — FPS scope view with breath sway, raycast targets\nexamples/threejs-hearts/       — 3D extruded heart bursts, floating 3D hearts\nexamples/threejs-fireworks/    — click sky to launch; mortar + 3D particle burst\nexamples/threejs-clicker/      — speed-clicker game with 17-tier FX ladder,\n                                 autoclicker + endless demo mode, WebAudio 8-bit\n                                 sound system with Shepard-tone rising pitch,\n                                 per-tier drone registry, and a ONE THOUSAND\n                                 fanfare for the 1000-click milestone.\n\nThe clicker demonstrates a ghost-card technique for rapid-fire input (plugin\nanimations run on a cloned ghost so the real clickable card stays stable),\nand a five-layer perf optimization (cleanupCard on removal + ghost concurrency\ncap + canvasOnly top tiers + CPS-aware throttle + frame coalesce) that keeps\nframe pacing flat at 30 cps autoclick through tier TRANSCENDENT.\n\nREADME: new Examples section links all eight demos with one-line summaries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b75cc1f3c85c3e7bbf97881c9e11d6e0974c966a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/trees/b75cc1f3c85c3e7bbf97881c9e11d6e0974c966a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/commits/926cb0334e996bce033ca6d45ba99d1520bc0fde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/926cb0334e996bce033ca6d45ba99d1520bc0fde","node_id":"C_kwDOSAUwK9oAKDkyNmNiMDMzNGU5OTZiY2UwMzNjYTZkNDViYTk5ZDE1MjBiYzBmZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/c71bf4304639bf0b8c186f7d95d73f9fc69f75bd","sha":"c71bf4304639bf0b8c186f7d95d73f9fc69f75bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/c71bf4304639bf0b8c186f7d95d73f9fc69f75bd"}],"sha":"926cb0334e996bce033ca6d45ba99d1520bc0fde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/926cb0334e996bce033ca6d45ba99d1520bc0fde"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/c71bf4304639bf0b8c186f7d95d73f9fc69f75bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:32:18Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:32:18Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"message":"fix(fx): center perspective-origin in promoteCard so lifted cards rise forward\n\n`perspective-origin` was set to the card''s left edge (`rect.left`), which\nplaced the entire card to the right of the vanishing point. When\n`translateZ(+peakZ)` scaled the card toward the viewer, every point on it\nprojected outward from the left-edge origin, so the card appeared to slide\nrightward as it rose. Centering the origin on the card\n(`rect.left + rect.width / 2`) makes it rise forward toward the viewer as\nintended.\n\nSilently fixes the same drift across every plugin that goes through\n`promoteCard()`: thud (10 variants), death / destroy (11 variants), cute\n(13 variants) — 34 variants total. creation, in-progress, and\nlist-animations don''t promote to 3D and weren''t affected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6817bcefb49cd38661d3d3a5e8d534add2bd738","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/trees/b6817bcefb49cd38661d3d3a5e8d534add2bd738"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/commits/c71bf4304639bf0b8c186f7d95d73f9fc69f75bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/c71bf4304639bf0b8c186f7d95d73f9fc69f75bd","node_id":"C_kwDOSAUwK9oAKGM3MWJmNDMwNDYzOWJmMGI4YzE4NmY3ZDk1ZDczZjlmYzY5Zjc1YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae","sha":"0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae"}],"sha":"c71bf4304639bf0b8c186f7d95d73f9fc69f75bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/c71bf4304639bf0b8c186f7d95d73f9fc69f75bd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:21:53Z","email":"alex@toto.tech","name":"Alex Funk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:21:53Z","email":"alex@toto.tech","name":"Alex Funk"},"message":"Release v0.3.1 — git-install fix\n\nBumps version to 0.3.1 and documents the git-install fix from #3 in the\nchangelog. No API changes. Consumers installing via\ngithub:a-funk/toto-fx#semver:^0.3.1 now get a working dist/ automatically.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e020eb81aa9ec9d526e882d16912dc47b1cf08a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/trees/5e020eb81aa9ec9d526e882d16912dc47b1cf08a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/commits/0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae","node_id":"C_kwDOSAUwK9oAKDBjYTVmZWJhZmQ0ZGRiMDJhN2Y1YTU1MDI1Nzg0NWJhYzliOWYxYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/51a94e41e035d0cb0d299f90b0233dd40d08123a","sha":"51a94e41e035d0cb0d299f90b0233dd40d08123a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/51a94e41e035d0cb0d299f90b0233dd40d08123a"}],"sha":"0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/0ca5febafd4ddb02a7f5a550257845bac9b9f1ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11507011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk","id":11507011,"login":"a-funk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTA3MDEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-funk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/51a94e41e035d0cb0d299f90b0233dd40d08123a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:20:56Z","email":"alexfunk1222@gmail.com","name":"a-funk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:20:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix git-install path: add prepare script + include build.js in package (#3)\n\nConsumers installing toto-fx from a GitHub tag (e.g. via npm''s\ngithub:a-funk/toto-fx#semver:^0.3.0 syntax) were getting a broken\ninstall: the npm ''files'' allowlist published to registry includes\n''dist/'' but the git source tree never commits ''dist/'' (it''s a build\noutput), and ''build.js'' was excluded from the allowlist so consumers\nhad no way to build it themselves.\n\nTwo changes:\n\n1. Add \"prepare\": \"node build.js\" to scripts. npm runs ''prepare''\n   automatically after installing a git dependency, immediately after\n   ''npm install'' resolves devDependencies in the cloned repo. This\n   produces dist/ before the consumer''s own install completes.\n\n2. Add \"build.js\" to the files allowlist so it ships to both npm\n   registry consumers and git consumers. Zero impact on bundle size\n   (file is 5.8KB and only used at install/build time).\n\nAfter this change, ''npm install github:a-funk/toto-fx#semver:^0.3.0''\nproduces a working toto-fx in node_modules with built dist/ bundles.\nNo consumer-side build step needed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alex Funk <alex@toto.tech>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da7662c0ddbffdf6b8ef5c38598ad3cbc89b0aee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/trees/da7662c0ddbffdf6b8ef5c38598ad3cbc89b0aee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/commits/51a94e41e035d0cb0d299f90b0233dd40d08123a","verification":{"payload":"tree da7662c0ddbffdf6b8ef5c38598ad3cbc89b0aee\nparent 2ea5306153ba7cc7145566f151aae89dc5a7b7b7\nauthor a-funk <alexfunk1222@gmail.com> 1776414056 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776414056 -0700\n\nFix git-install path: add prepare script + include build.js in package (#3)\n\nConsumers installing toto-fx from a GitHub tag (e.g. via npm''s\ngithub:a-funk/toto-fx#semver:^0.3.0 syntax) were getting a broken\ninstall: the npm ''files'' allowlist published to registry includes\n''dist/'' but the git source tree never commits ''dist/'' (it''s a build\noutput), and ''build.js'' was excluded from the allowlist so consumers\nhad no way to build it themselves.\n\nTwo changes:\n\n1. Add \"prepare\": \"node build.js\" to scripts. npm runs ''prepare''\n   automatically after installing a git dependency, immediately after\n   ''npm install'' resolves devDependencies in the cloned repo. This\n   produces dist/ before the consumer''s own install completes.\n\n2. Add \"build.js\" to the files allowlist so it ships to both npm\n   registry consumers and git consumers. Zero impact on bundle size\n   (file is 5.8KB and only used at install/build time).\n\nAfter this change, ''npm install github:a-funk/toto-fx#semver:^0.3.0''\nproduces a working toto-fx in node_modules with built dist/ bundles.\nNo consumer-side build step needed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alex Funk <alex@toto.tech>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4e1oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAaUQADX6c0bGJOBEKsVX1pwNrTYf\nAOlhxyId05l/BGQD+FYX2RurcloFHLlIsfwCB4gjxBW6nZ8mmUsTtpyusbh3cmjc\nZ8EywvPkzkbu1Uytc2WQxOx769n/AYMNQloqxx2HGITq1LCmrE0x8+GZ/cL6CSJN\nl9xVPHUiUV/hvifxKaHn+s+cfR/JJZ3VPt4hjEYEUSwOWd0g1WGjE8rnJjjdXzv1\n0fCdZ3UxcEe7XRFbygFQoOukT3Fqb/lH5eZhoLlB8fmgdNyinC4ThuHNS+XIHuoR\nFyJOLfCyFCkToLehZrTI7dIgMwkPbiBdkDCcJJgqeqHC66u3AMG2TyRPcSOuy9OV\nbY0jSxnz8uDmmVIFeEo00ENtH4NY2BXi3hA+BJEjE3