ations, with anime-slam as worked example\n- Added AnimationRegistry.getParams() for runtime param introspection\n- Documented the params.params naming rationale (engine context vs\n  variant-specific values, chosen to avoid key collisions)","tree":{"sha":"ba40dad95c6667b09d47d7d31e674004eb0b24c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/trees/ba40dad95c6667b09d47d7d31e674004eb0b24c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/commits/ca1a428b6d505451d5559f76c3adb8b947d96165","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/ca1a428b6d505451d5559f76c3adb8b947d96165","node_id":"C_kwDOSAUwK9oAKGNhMWE0MjhiNmQ1MDU0NTFkNTU1OWY3NmMzYWRiOGI5NDdkOTYxNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/38fbe5a8af2cce1acc2fdd4d2339a3e9fbf25439","sha":"38fbe5a8af2cce1acc2fdd4d2339a3e9fbf25439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/38fbe5a8af2cce1acc2fdd4d2339a3e9fbf25439"}],"sha":"ca1a428b6d505451d5559f76c3adb8b947d96165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/ca1a428b6d505451d5559f76c3adb8b947d96165"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/38fbe5a8af2cce1acc2fdd4d2339a3e9fbf25439/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T07:07:16Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T07:07:16Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"message":"Add live demo link to toto.tech/playground","tree":{"sha":"5d5b746274540e196c0ed1f5c0d0f3b550510ef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/trees/5d5b746274540e196c0ed1f5c0d0f3b550510ef2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/commits/38fbe5a8af2cce1acc2fdd4d2339a3e9fbf25439","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/38fbe5a8af2cce1acc2fdd4d2339a3e9fbf25439","node_id":"C_kwDOSAUwK9oAKDM4ZmJlNWE4YWYyY2NlMWFjYzJmZGQ0ZDIzMzlhM2U5ZmJmMjU0Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/013b5ab659ef99b61617de72424397f42b4656f5","sha":"013b5ab659ef99b61617de72424397f42b4656f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/013b5ab659ef99b61617de72424397f42b4656f5"}],"sha":"38fbe5a8af2cce1acc2fdd4d2339a3e9fbf25439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/38fbe5a8af2cce1acc2fdd4d2339a3e9fbf25439"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/commits/013b5ab659ef99b61617de72424397f42b4656f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T07:02:27Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T07:02:27Z","email":"funk@Funks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Funk"},"message":"Add debug mode, public resolveElement, use FX in demo\n\n- engine.createEngine({ debug: true }) enables console warnings for\n  common mistakes: wrong arg types to play/set, unregistered categories,\n  detached elements\n- engine.resolveElement(key) exposed as public method (was internal-only,\n  but used in Getting Started example)\n- examples/index.html now uses FX.spawnParticles(), FX.doScreenShake(),\n  FX.doImpactFlash(), and FX.doDotgridRipple/Crater instead of a\n  hand-rolled particle system\n- Updated README API reference and TypeScript definitions","tree":{"sha":"84923defd05feef613ad03376ce81b770671e65e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/trees/84923defd05feef613ad03376ce81b770671e65e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-funk/toto-fx/git/commits/013b5ab659ef99b61617de72424397f42b4656f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/a-funk/toto-fx/commit/013b5ab659ef99b61617de72424