PI module - move core application files\n\nMoved all core application files to the geosmart-api module:\n- GeoSmartApplication.java (main application entry point)\n- AppConfig.java (Spring configuration)\n- ChatConfig.java, GeoSmartAssistant.java (AI service configuration)\n- ChatController.java, DocumentController.java (REST API controllers)\n- ChatRequest.java (DTO)\n- application.yml, application-dev.yml (configuration files)\n- sample-docs/ (sample data files)\n- ChatControllerTest.java (test files)\n\nAll files maintain their original package structure. The API module now\nproperly depends on all other modules (llm, chat, tools, rag).\n\nVerification:\n- API module compiles successfully with all dependencies resolved\n- Complete parent POM build succeeds (mvn clean compile)\n- All old source directories removed\n\nThis completes Task 6 of the backend modularization refactoring.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee356f0eca3fb0aaa0f68ad2e75f46bf39e615d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/git/trees/ee356f0eca3fb0aaa0f68ad2e75f46bf39e615d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/git/commits/f2435ec3bf582442d9c0a5ac412153a9ce016276","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162148736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RainbowJier","id":162148736,"login":"RainbowJier","node_id":"U_kgDOCaoxgA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/commit/f2435ec3bf582442d9c0a5ac412153a9ce016276","node_id":"C_kwDOSAYmpdoAKGYyNDM1ZWMzYmY1ODI0NDJkOWMwYTVhYzQxMjE1M2E5Y2UwMTYyNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/commit/ebc6923ffc4d741dc7533237ec78512a1b1f99bc","sha":"ebc6923ffc4d741dc7533237ec78512a1b1f99bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/commits/ebc6923ffc4d741dc7533237ec78512a1b1f99bc"}],"sha":"f2435ec3bf582442d9c0a5ac412153a9ce016276","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/commits/f2435ec3bf582442d9c0a5ac412153a9ce016276"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162148736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RainbowJier","id":162148736,"login":"RainbowJier","node_id":"U_kgDOCaoxgA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/commits/ebc6923ffc4d741dc7533237ec78512a1b1f99bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T12:37:43Z","email":"3021809270@qq.com","name":"Rainbow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T12:37:43Z","email":"3021809270@qq.com","name":"Rainbow"},"message":"refactor(modules): migrate RAG module to geosmart-rag\n\n完成 RAG 模块迁移，包括文档摄入、向量化和检索功能。\n\n## 主要变更：\n- 移动 DocumentIngestionService.java → geosmart-rag/src/main/java/com/geosmart/rag/\n- 移动 EmbeddingConfig.java → geosmart-rag/src/main/java/com/geosmart/rag/\n- 移动 RetrievalService.java → geosmart-rag/src/main/java/com/geosmart/rag/\n- 移动 DocumentIngestionServiceTest.java → geosmart-rag/src/test/java/com/geosmart/rag/\n\n## 架构调整：\n- 将 EmbeddingModel Bean 定义从 RAG 模块迁移到 LLM 模块（LlmConfig）\n- RAG 模块现在通过依赖 geosmart-llm 模块获取 EmbeddingModel\n- EmbeddingConfig 现在只负责配置 EmbeddingStore\n- RAG 模块测试依赖保留了 langchain4j-embeddings-all-minilm-l6-v2\n\n## 验证：\n- RAG 模块编译成功\n- 所有模块父 POM 编译成功\n- RAG 模块单元测试通过（DocumentIngestionServiceTest）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e4b65eb10677bbd98024b3535412d09ea901b85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/git/trees/0e4b65eb10677bbd98024b3535412d09ea901b85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/git/commits/ebc6923ffc4d741dc7533237ec78512a1b1f99bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162148736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rainbow