ning domain\n- ChatSessionManager for per-session chat memory with configurable window\n- ChatConfig wiring AiServices with chatModel, streamingChatModel, RAG retriever, and agent tools\n- ChatController with POST /api/chat (SSE streaming), GET /api/chat/history/{sessionId}, DELETE /api/chat/session/{sessionId}\n- DocumentController with POST /api/documents/upload and GET /api/documents\n- ChatControllerTest verifying history and session clearing endpoints\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5de5487ede4eb951e3cd0202340104bbb2dce30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/git/trees/f5de5487ede4eb951e3cd0202340104bbb2dce30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/git/commits/511568584bc96e5b8da2236f22eca2dc5a04b53a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162148736?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RainbowJier","id":162148736,"login":"RainbowJier","node_id":"U_kgDOCaoxgA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainbowJier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RainbowJier/LangChain4j-Tutorial-Steps/commit/511568