nment variables for database connections in subgraph services.\n- Included commands for database migrations and seeding during service startup.\n\nfeat: implement GraphQL code generation setup\n\n- Created `codegen.ts` for generating TypeScript types from the supergraph schema.\n- Added `package.json` for managing dependencies and scripts related to GraphQL types.\n- Implemented `index.ts` to define shared GraphQL TypeScript types.\n\nchore: add Apollo Router configuration\n\n- Added `router.yaml` for Apollo Router setup, including CORS and subscription support.\n- Configured response caching and persisted queries.\n\nchore: define supergraph schema configuration\n\n- Created `supergraph.yaml` to define subgraphs and their routing URLs for Apollo Federation.","tree":{"sha":"fff4cc635b2e73847f20aa1680fdd8883afd2a47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raydedon/turbo-repo-project/git/trees/fff4cc635b2e73847f20aa1680fdd8883afd2a47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raydedon/turbo-repo-project/git/commits/8da662accc47f1c7dd9478ac1943b363d583a56f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10681883?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raydedon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raydedon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raydedon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raydedon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/raydedon","id":10681883,"login":"raydedon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgxODgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raydedon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raydedon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raydedon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raydedon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use