ers/Danendz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz","id":47881901,"login":"Danendz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODgxOTAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commits/c34f5fe76a1dd05127e437eafb40ca3a3e0afb58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:38:22Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:38:22Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"message":"Add deep AST introspection for hooks, deps, locals, and prop origins\n\n- Extended ast-utils with findHookCallsDeep (recursive custom hook parsing),\n  dep array extraction, local var finder, prop origin tracing, import source\n  resolution, and Vue reactive() property finder\n- React adapter now injects __devtools_meta (replaces __devtools_hooks) with\n  nested hook tree, dep names, local variables, and prop origins in usage map\n- Fiber walker reads __devtools_meta to build nested InspectorItem tree with\n  dep names/values, falls back to legacy __devtools_hooks format\n- Render-cause diffHooks now detects which specific deps changed for\n  effects/memos/callbacks with old/new values per dep\n- Extended types: InspectorItem (innerHooks, depNames, depValues, sourceFile),\n  NormalizedNode (locals, propOrigins), ChangedHook (changedDeps),\n  CommitComponentEntry (effectChanges)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b31fa659af7b8540a180a03788e5e5cb12771b56","url":"https://api.github.c