DX: infer hook types, capture state diffs, smarter hints\n\n- Infer actual hook type (useState, useEffect, etc.) in diffHooks() instead\n  of generic \"hook\" label, by reusing inferHookType from fiber-walker\n- Capture previousHookValues/nextHookValues for state change diffs alongside\n  existing prop value diffs in the Renders tab and MCP output\n- Implement lastRenderedCommit tracking so bailed-out components show when\n  they last actually rendered in the detail panel\n- Add fuzzy (case-insensitive substring) matching to getRenderCauses MCP tool\n- Detect React.memo-wrapped components and show context-aware hints (check\n  parent''s inline objects vs suggest wrapping in memo)\n- Update hook display format to \"varName (hookType)\" across tree tooltip,\n  detail panel, and renders pane\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"298d847b9302cb98feb9c5f586b8f15ff9083908","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/trees/298d847b9302cb98feb9c5f586b8f15ff9083908"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/commits/8ada29f168f2e94c4f0406cf97c85c0cacb6bba2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47881901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz","id":47881901,"login":"Danendz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODgxOTAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commit/8ada29f168f2e94c4f0406cf97c85c0cacb6bba2","node_id":"C_kwDOSAb-B9oAKDhhZGEyOWYxNjhmMmU5NGM0ZjA0MDZjZjk3Yzg1YzBjYWNiNmJiYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commit/0f612da183e7ccfe018281ffb81ad52e8e809eee","sha":"0f612da183e7ccfe018281ffb81ad52e8e809eee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commits/0f612da183e7ccfe018281ffb81ad52e8e809eee"}],"sha":"8ada29f168f2e94c4f0406cf97c85c0cacb6bba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commits/8ada29f168f2e94c4f0406cf97c85c0cacb6bba2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47881901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz","id":47881901,"login":"Danendz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODgxOTAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commits/0f612da183e7ccfe018281ffb81ad52e8e809eee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T06:40:59Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T06:40:59Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"message":"Fix false render-cause labels on bailed-out subtrees and add pip pulse animation\n\nBailout detection was broken in two ways: (1) React doesn''t clear\nPerformedWork flags on skipped subtrees, causing stale flags to\nmislabel bailed-out components as \"parent re-rendered\", and (2) fibers\nin entirely skipped subtrees keep stale alternates from prior commits,\ncausing false prop/state diffs. Fixed by adding a WeakMap snapshot that\ntracks each fiber''s props/state refs across walks — if identical, the\nfiber is correctly detected as bailout regardless of stale flags or\nalternates. Also adds a 300ms scale-pulse animation on render-cause\npips, scoped to only components that were part of the current commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2aa0b2dee09a026a0eeee075c31574d8e3d1c96a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/trees/2aa0b2dee09a026a0eeee075c31574d8e3d1c96a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/commits/0f612da183e7ccfe018281ffb81ad52e8e809eee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47881901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz","id":47881901,"login":"Danendz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODgxOTAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commit/0f612da183e7ccfe018281ffb81ad52e8e809eee","node_id":"C_kwDOSAb-B9oAKDBmNjEyZGExODNlN2NjZmUwMTgyODFmZmI4MWFkNTJlOGU4MDllZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commit/94d0623d52296a0fb3cae2def9c4b82a3a9aaa2f","sha":"94d0623d52296a0fb3cae2def9c4b82a3a9aaa2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commits/94d0623d52296a0fb3cae2def9c4b82a3a9aaa2f"}],"sha":"0f612da183e7ccfe018281ffb81ad52e8e809eee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commits/0f612da183e7ccfe018281ffb81ad52e8e809eee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47881901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz","id":47881901,"login":"Danendz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODgxOTAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commits/94d0623d52296a0fb3cae2def9c4b82a3a9aaa2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T04:50:11Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T04:50:11Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"message":"Add render-cause attribution with live tree pips, Renders tab, and MCP tools\n\nLabel why each React component re-rendered: props, state, context, parent\ncascade, mount, or bailout. Shown as colored pips in the tree, a \"Why\"\nsection in DetailPanel, and a full Renders tab with commit timeline,\ncause filters, and expandable value diffs.\n\nMCP tools: getRenderHistory, getRenderCauses, getHotComponents,\nclearRenderHistory, setRenderHistoryRecording.\n\nKey implementation details:\n- Cross-commit fiber identity via WeakMap (handles React 19 frozen fibers)\n- isKnownFiber() check prevents false mount labels when React detaches alternates\n- Max-delay debounce (200ms cap) ensures rapid commits still get recorded\n- Circular-ref safety net in bridge serialization for hook linked lists\n- Opt-in via Settings toggle, default off\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"531250d1ef1419bbd89ef5753c38cb569185e8a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/trees/531250d1ef1419bbd89ef5753c38cb569185e8a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/commits/94d0623d52296a0fb3cae2def9c4b82a3a9aaa2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47881901?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz","id":47881901,"login":"Danendz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODgxOTAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use