ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commits/969c1b51ac2a89fa7c6deeefa67f4ad26e4990dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T16:37:55Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T16:37:55Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"message":"Add editable HTML attributes, Vue text persistence, and host element source fixes\n\n- Make host element attributes (class, href, id, etc.) editable in DetailPanel\n  with persist-to-source support for both React and Vue adapters\n- Add direct DOM manipulation for live attribute preview via setAttribute\n- Fix Vue static hoisted elements showing wrong source (App.vue:1) by calling\n  getElementSource in domElementToNode\n- Add hostElementRefMap to Vue instance walker for host element PROP_EDIT handling\n- Move PERSIST_TEXT endpoint from React adapter to shared plugin-factory,\n  enabling Vue text persistence\n- Fix findTemplateElement to find closest element instead of first match\n- Fix React 19+ host element source locations by always injecting __source\n- Reset EditablePropValue state when selected node changes\n- Show toast on all persist errors including preview mode\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52c2b2d088a4f4eba0b873a9561f94bda131d198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/trees/52c2b2d088a4f4eba0b873a9561f94bda131d198"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/commits/969c1b51ac2a89fa7c6deeefa67f4ad26e4990dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47881901?