sts{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Danendz","id":47881901,"login":"Danendz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODgxOTAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Danendz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/commits/521dcad32a4c8e2ff6e9b41f1543126be69a1fec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T12:31:44Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T12:31:44Z","email":"danilapayne@gmail.com","name":"Danendz"},"message":"Add Vue element tree expansion, text ownership on host elements, and source fallback\n\n- Vue adapter: extend SFC scanner to track HTML element tags in usage map,\n  walk element vnodes with order-based source matching and WalkContext\n- React/Vue: host elements now show text on the owning element instead of\n  parent component, with textFragments and editing support\n- Library host elements fall back to parent component source for navigation\n- Detect JSX source transform (OXC/SWC) to avoid duplicate __source injection\n- Handle React''s optimized single-text-child (string in memoizedProps.children)\n- Use HTML element whitelist to prevent false positives on lowercase components\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a76aec37054fd37a9b993e6fcf9e93efab4b45c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/trees/9a76aec37054fd37a9b993e6fcf9e93efab4b45c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Danendz/vite-dev-tools/git/commits/521dcad32a4c8e2ff6e9b41f1543126be69a1fec","verification":{"p