`environment: prod` on the reusable workflow''s job is what\nactually resolves the env-scoped secrets, `secrets: inherit` on the\ncaller is still required to enable the secrets context to flow into the\ncalled workflow. Without it the called workflow receives no secrets\ncontext and its `environment:` lookup returns empty values, leading to\nconfigure-aws-credentials@v4 failing with \"Could not load credentials\nfrom any providers\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d0d9844018e2fc2d705f2e93053151b31a5efa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/trees/1d0d9844018e2fc2d705f2e93053151b31a5efa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/commits/ded3648ea1d2c910a29c6b1c1481e499a598f082","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24195935?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar","id":24195935,"login":"EduardoMolinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTk1OTM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commit/ded3648ea1d2c910a