olinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commits/e04a004d10a98bce59ac397575ac2cf1dd1f69be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T00:56:20Z","email":"eduardomolinar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Molinar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T00:56:20Z","email":"eduardomolinar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Molinar"},"message":"Phase 7 (2/2): follow / unfollow buttons across remotes\n\n- mfe-live: LiveNow builds vm$ combining auth + sports data + follow state;\n  MatchCard gains homeFollowing/awayFollowing inputs and homeFollowToggle/awayFollowToggle outputs\n- mfe-competition: CompetitionList and CompetitionDetail inject PROFILE_SERVICE\n  and show follow pills; shared competitions.data.ts for consistent metadata\n- mfe-profile: TeamTile and CompetitionTile gain (unfollow) output + Remove button;\n  ProfilePage wires unfollows to service; list shrinks reactively via BehaviorSubject store\n- Both mfe-live and mfe-competition remote.routes.ts bind PROFILE_SERVICE on\n  route-level providers (Phase 5 rule; AUTH_SERVICE inherited from shell)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"257ce868ba78b6c068c532408402be3495e83114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/trees/257ce868ba78b6c068c532408402be3495e83114"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/commits/e04a004d10a98bce59ac397575ac2cf1dd1f69be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24195935?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com