4195935,"login":"EduardoMolinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTk1OTM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commits/372194635a6f95eee81f723e2cb10078c1dcf0e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T00:56:08Z","email":"eduardomolinar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Molinar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T00:56:08Z","email":"eduardomolinar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Molinar"},"message":"Phase 7 (1/2): profile service write methods + reactive store\n\n- Extend ProfileService interface with followTeam/unfollowTeam/followCompetition/unfollowCompetition\n  and isFollowingTeam$/isFollowingCompetition$ reactive predicates\n- Rewrite MockProfileService: BehaviorSubject<Map> store with cloneStore() semantics\n  so writes reactively invalidate reads without manual re-fetch\n- 17 tests covering seeded reads, write-path mutations, idempotency,\n  unknown-user safety, and observable transitions (true→false→true)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d0fc228fff037968c330a9c997bf15a2f4c1b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/trees/9d0fc228fff037968c330a9c997bf15a2f4c1b1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/commits/372194635a6f95eee81f723e2cb10078c1dcf0e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24195935?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar","id":24195935,"login":"EduardoMolinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTk1OTM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commit/372194635a6f95eee81f723e2cb10078c1dcf0e8","node_id":"C_kwDOSA3iltoAKDM3MjE5NDYzNWE2Zjk1ZWVlODFmNzIzZTJjYjEwMDc4YzFkY2YwZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commit/ca619437a6fc8902a4fa5a3bc92d246cf23c6a2a","sha":"ca619437a6fc8902a4fa5a3bc92d246cf23c6a2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commits/ca619437a6fc8902a4fa5a3bc92d246cf23c6a2a"}],"sha":"372194635a6f95eee81f723e2cb10078c1dcf0e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commits/372194635a6f95eee81f723e2cb10078c1dcf0e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24195935?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar","id":24195935,"login":"EduardoMolinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTk1OTM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commits/ca619437a6fc8902a4fa5a3bc92d246cf23c6a2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T23:54:46Z","email":"eduardomolinar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Molinar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T23:54:46Z","email":"eduardomolinar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Molinar"},"message":"Phase 6 (2/2): auth bootstrap in shell + profile page on mfe-profile\n\nShell:\n- app.config.ts binds AUTH_SERVICE via useExisting: MockAuthService\n  (shell is the real bootstrap entry point — correct place per CLAUDE.md)\n- app.ts injects AUTH_SERVICE and exposes currentUser$ stream\n- app.html shows \"Hi, {displayName}\" greeting beside the top-nav\n- app.scss positions the greeting with DS tokens only\n\nmfe-profile:\n- remote.routes.ts binds PROFILE_SERVICE on the exposed route''s providers\n  (Phase-5 rule: never app.config for federated remotes)\n- ProfilePage reads AUTH_SERVICE.currentUser$, pipes userId into\n  ProfileService for getFavoriteTeams + getFavoriteCompetitions\n- TeamTile and CompetitionTile are domain-local presentation components\n\nnx graph: shell->auth, mfe-profile->auth+profile; no cross-remote edges,\nshell does not depend on profile.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2fdca149375ee21bec096777d39af0728f785b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/trees/a2fdca149375ee21bec096777d39af0728f785b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/commits/ca619437a6fc8902a4fa5a3bc92d246cf23c6a2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24195935?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar","id":24195935,"login":"EduardoMolinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTk1OTM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commit/ca619437a6fc8902a4fa5a3bc92d246cf23c6a2a","node_id":"C_kwDOSA3iltoAKGNhNjE5NDM3YTZmYzg5MDJhNGZhNWEzYmM5MmQyNDZjZjIzYzZhMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commit/bdc1615351d72ff413cddd9397ee60a9454dad20","sha":"bdc1615351d72ff413cddd9397ee60a9454dad20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commits/bdc1615351d72ff413cddd9397ee60a9454dad20"}],"sha":"ca619437a6fc8902a4fa5a3bc92d246cf23c6a2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commits/ca619437a