user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar","id":24195935,"login":"EduardoMolinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTk1OTM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/commits/7a60cf5b058611904982d40f2e95273e5827e12d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T01:46:19Z","email":"eduardomolinar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Molinar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T01:46:19Z","email":"eduardomolinar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Molinar"},"message":"Phase 4: sports-data mock lib + first live-scores feature on mfe-live\n\nAdd the @platform/sports-data library with a SportsDataService contract,\nSPORTS_DATA_SERVICE InjectionToken, and a MockSportsDataService that serves a\nfixed set of live UCL / La Liga / Premier League / international matches from\nan in-memory fixture. Extend @platform/shared-types with MatchSummary, Score,\nTeamSide, and MatchStatus. Replace the mfe-live landing page with a LiveNow\nfeature that subscribes to getLiveMatches() and renders a MatchCard per match\nusing DsCard, DsBadge and DsList. Wire the mock provider in mfe-live''s app\nconfig so the real HTTP impl can swap in behind the token later.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5bac892c7270f857ca17ab9c742069ed5e0b510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/trees/e5bac892