s: pure date/status helpers\n- libs/auth: AuthService (signals), authGuard, authInterceptor, provideAuth()\n\nPhase 1 — Shell:\n- apps/shell: dynamic Module Federation host, ShellLayoutComponent (sidebar + topbar), login stub, provideAuth() bootstrap\n\nPhase 2 — MFE Remotes:\n- apps/mfe-home (port 4201): exposes HOME_ROUTES\n- apps/mfe-live (port 4202): exposes LIVE_ROUTES\n- apps/mfe-competition (port 4203): exposes COMPETITION_ROUTES\n- apps/mfe-team (port 4204): exposes TEAM_ROUTES\n- apps/mfe-profile (port 4205): exposes PROFILE_ROUTES\n\nAll projects: lint passing, tests passing (5/5 remotes, 83 DS, 7 auth, 4 shell)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"730eb754eeb1066beda7d949542bead42df7a6c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/trees/730eb754eeb1066beda7d949542bead42df7a6c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EduardoMolinar/kick-platform/git/commits/47cdaa777576db6365b6a0d9eb08a032f35dd153","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24195935?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EduardoMolinar","id":24195935,"login":"EduardoMolinar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MTk1OTM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EduardoMolina